1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,856
Do you ever look in the mirror
and wonder…

2
00:00:02,896 --> 00:00:04,156
Where did I go?

3
00:00:04,196 --> 00:00:07,349
Your memory. Your confidence.
Your desire.

4
00:00:07,424 --> 00:00:10,031
Even your body feels unfamiliar.

5
00:00:10,385 --> 00:00:12,620
Menopause could be part
of the reason.

6
00:00:12,695 --> 00:00:17,589
Hormone replacement therapy,
or HRT, can improve sleep,

7
00:00:17,664 --> 00:00:22,871
ease hot flashes, vaginal dryness
and menopause-related low mood.

8
00:00:23,225 --> 00:00:25,901
Side effects include
headaches and spotting.

9
00:00:26,255 --> 00:00:30,000
Some treatments increase
blood clot or breast cancer risk.

10
00:00:30,261 --> 00:00:34,273
But decades of fear shouldn’t
silence today’s conversations.

11
00:00:34,719 --> 00:00:38,441
Ask your doctor whether
HRT is right for you.

12
00:00:38,887 --> 00:00:41,564
Menopause doesn’t mean
losing yourself.
